        <headline>High Wind Warning issued September 26 at 4:17AM MDT until September 26 at 12:00PM MDT by NWS Great Falls MT</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Westerly winds 30 to 50 mph, with gusts up to 70 mph
expected.

* WHERE...Eastern Glacier, Western Toole, and Central Pondera,
Northern High Plains, and Southern High Plains.

* WHEN...Until noon MDT today.

* IMPACTS...Travel could be difficult, especially for high profile
vehicles.
</description>
        <instruction>People are urged to secure loose objects that could be blown around
or damaged by the wind.</instruction>
